## Enforcement

**Before starting ANY fix:**
1. Check if working reference exists
2. If yes, analyze it first
3. Document findings before attempting replication
4. Compare every build against working reference

**When committing findings:**
- Include "Analyzed working bin: YES/NO"
- If NO, explain why (e.g., no working version exists)
- If YES, cite the analysis document

**When user says "this works":**
- Immediate response: "Provide bin path, analyzing now"
- No guessing allowed until analysis complete
